### E-Commerce Inventory API — request collection
### Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above any block.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ---------- Health ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Service info
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ---------- Products ----------

### List products (first call = MySQL, second = Redis; compare meta.cached)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&limit=10

### List again — should report "cached": true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&limit=10

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=Electronics&limit=5

### Search by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=Keyboard

### Distinct categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/categories

### Single product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ergonomic Office Chair",
  "description": "Lumbar support, mesh back",
  "category": "Home",
  "price": 12499.00,
  "stock_quantity": 15
}

### Update a product (partial)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 9999.00,
  "stock_quantity": 40
}

### Delete a product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### ---------- Validation failures ----------

### Missing name -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Home",
  "price": 100
}

### Negative price -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken",
  "category": "Home",
  "price": -50
}

### Unknown product -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999999

### ---------- Orders ----------

### Place an order (decrements stock atomically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_email": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 2, "quantity": 2 },
    { "product_id": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Oversell attempt -> 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK with available count
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_email": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 2, "quantity": 999999 }
  ]
}

### Invalid email -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_email": "not-an-email",
  "items": [{ "product_id": 2, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&limit=10

### Filter orders by customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?email=buyer@example.com

### Order detail with line items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

### Cancel an order (restores stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/cancel
